# Grist's −5: "Each opponent loses life equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard." Turn 5's +1 mills
# Haywire Mite, a second Grist and Llanowar Elves. The milled Grist is an Insect card in the graveyard (her first
# ability works there), so the +1 repeats on it as on the Mite (loyalty 3 + 1 + 2 = 6), and turn 7's −5 counts it
# among the three creature cards (the ruling).

[Bot1 Deck]
Bayou x3
Grist, the Hunger Tide
Forest x5
Haywire Mite
Grist, the Hunger Tide
Llanowar Elves
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x22

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#1.Activate(Ability: Add {B})
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#2.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#3.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Hand.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Activate(Ability: +1)
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Counters.Loyalty = 6
? Bot1.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Grist, the Hunger Tide; Haywire Mite
Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Activate(Ability: Each opponent)
[T7 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Counters.Loyalty = 1
Bot2.Life = 17
